        definition: "The degree to which a system\u2019s outputs create enforceable obligations\u2014deadlines, duties, remedies, or reversals\u2014rather than mere communications. Bindingness is the difference between \u201Cwe received your request\u201D and \u201Cwe must decide by Friday or you win.\u201D",
